[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3061.39, "timestamp": "00:51:01", "text": "等等，稍等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3064.95, "timestamp": "00:51:04", "text": "有时候生活真的太不公平了。抓住"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3066.47, "timestamp": "00:51:06", "text": "在。坚持，稍等。坚持，稍等。坚持，稍等。住口。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3076.47, "timestamp": "00:51:16", "text": "时间。我的天啊。曾是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3079.19, "timestamp": "00:51:19", "text": "呃，我们可以要头垫或者心形表情符号吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3081.75, "timestamp": "00:51:21", "text": "是在聊天记录里吗？蓝色的心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3085.03, "timestamp": "00:51:25", "text": "Zen在聊天中用表情符号表达心意，让她感觉好一些。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3089.692, "timestamp": "00:51:29", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "💙💙💙💙💙"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3093.022, "timestamp": "00:51:33", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "❤"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3094.15, "timestamp": "00:51:34", "text": "如果你们能帮忙，那对我意义重大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3105.63, "timestamp": "00:51:45", "text": "您好，欢迎回来。非常感谢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3107.91, "timestamp": "00:51:47", "text": "很多。你知道有这个吗？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3109.006, "timestamp": "00:51:49", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "💙💙💙💙"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3111.67, "timestamp": "00:51:51", "text": "那个理论叫什么来着？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3112.91, "timestamp": "00:51:52", "author": "@notSojasu", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/9iC0_w5nBHNC4BhGgiYeUdW6ZfCOGIbrmqCvaFZ2PV9zycbIf4HhyAZJDeqpX-v3fXW6q93S=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "💙💙💙💙💙💙"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3113.829, "t